flowchart TD
    A[Skeleton XML] -->|load_skeleton| B[Skeleton]
    C[Animation XML] -->|load_animation_clip| D[AnimationClip]

    B --> E[AnimationPlayer]
    D --> E

    E -->|evaluate dt| F[Local Transforms]
    F -->|compute_world_transforms| G[World Transforms mat4]

    H[CollisionSystem] -->|ground_height_at| I[Ground Height]
    G --> J[Foot IK Solver]
    I --> J

    J --> K[Adjusted World Transforms]
    K -->|skeleton_to_renderables| L[RenderEntities]

    M[Attachment Points] --> N[attachment_to_renderables]
    K --> N
    N --> O[Gun/Weapon RenderEntities]

    L --> P[Renderer]
    O --> P

    style A fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style C fill:#f9f,stroke:#333
    style P fill:#9f9,stroke:#333
